@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    Decorating a function with ``@retry`` no longer raises ``AttributeError`` when the
+    module global ``tenacity.tornado`` has been set to ``None``. Tornado availability is
+    now read at decoration time.
